{"title": "Fiendish Vice (Condition)", "pageid": 26311, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Fiendish_Vice_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fiendish Vice Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Blood_Elixir_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Fiendish Vice</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity can call on diabolic arcana to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thaumaturgy\" title=\"Thaumaturgy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/25px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/38px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/50px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thaumaturgy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/25px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thaumaturgy\" title=\"Thaumaturgy\">Thaumaturgy</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/25px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/38px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/50px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellish Rebuke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/25px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\">Hellish Rebuke</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Hands\" title=\"Burning Hands\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Hands\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Hands\" title=\"Burning Hands\">Burning Hands</a>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/38px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/50px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a> once each until the next <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MOO_BLOODPOTION_TIEFLING</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMOO_BLOODPOTION_TIEFLING%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CMOO_BLOODPOTION_TIEFLING%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: replace current</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Hands\" title=\"Burning Hands\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/60px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/80px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Hands\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp/40px-Burning_Hands_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Burning_Hands_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Hands\" title=\"Burning Hands\">Burning Hands</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Level 1 Spell Slot\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Level 1 Spell Slot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Each flammable target is hit with <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">3d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/60px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/80px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Level 2 Spell Slot\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Level 2 Spell Slot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Conjure a flaming <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Flame Blade (weapon)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/61/Flame_Blade_Weapon_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade_(weapon)\" title=\"Flame Blade (weapon)\">Scimitar</a> in your hand for 10 turns that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">3d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage. It sheds a bright light in a 3 m (10 ft) radius and a dim light in a 6 m (20 ft) radius. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/40px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/60px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/80px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hellish Rebuke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp/40px-Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/82/Hellish_Rebuke_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hellish_Rebuke\" title=\"Hellish Rebuke\">Hellish Rebuke</a> (<span aria-label=\"Reaction\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> + <span aria-label=\"Level 1 Spell Slot\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Level 1 Spell Slot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>React to your next attacker with flames that deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d10</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thaumaturgy\" title=\"Thaumaturgy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/40px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/60px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/80px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thaumaturgy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp/40px-Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3f/Thaumaturgy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thaumaturgy\" title=\"Thaumaturgy\">Thaumaturgy</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title